    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/355213fdecb7cfe841fde7dca9d6cdfc.avif?t=1738305487\" width=611 height=64 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;If you're good at Rock Scissors Paper, you'll get a huge paycheck!<br>And the customers here are all girls!<br>They're all beautiful!&quot;<br><br>Qualifications: NONE<br>Contact: 010-XXXX-XXXX<br>( This position may close early, so if you're interested, get in touch soon! )</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/19c566c42027e2108da17dd3332de441.avif?t=1738305487\" width=611 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/e124e3b2222bae177d13b4d0d442d891.poster.avif?t=1738305487\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/e124e3b2222bae177d13b4d0d442d891.webm?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/e124e3b2222bae177d13b4d0d442d891.mp4?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- You must match your opponent's symbols in the race!<br>If you don't play any cards, your multiplier will be reset with a null lose!<br>You can get more coins if you can keep a winning or losing streak going!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/9e54ea28a036ba99749ba29eacda8b10.poster.avif?t=1738305487\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/9e54ea28a036ba99749ba29eacda8b10.webm?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/9e54ea28a036ba99749ba29eacda8b10.mp4?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- As the round progresses, the odds will be stacked against you!<br>You'll have to choose your battles wisely, because they might even work in your favor!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/ffe78e3a402e85643a642dd99164e165.avif?t=1738305487\" width=611 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/0caa6ab326f91c8515cea45ef31e0beb.poster.avif?t=1738305487\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/0caa6ab326f91c8515cea45ef31e0beb.webm?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/0caa6ab326f91c8515cea45ef31e0beb.mp4?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- I'll give you a gift at the end of each turn! Build your deck in any direction you want!<br>Some cards can be placed in the race, others can be used directly!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/a31ea1aad4103fbb3b5430e9bed82397.poster.avif?t=1738305487\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/a31ea1aad4103fbb3b5430e9bed82397.webm?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/a31ea1aad4103fbb3b5430e9bed82397.mp4?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- There are also useful tags you can attach to your cards so you don't forget them!<br>You can trigger a card twice, or make it the first card drawn at the start of the round!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/041c57d9ba5ca1d45ac3f9248da90764.avif?t=1738305487\" width=611 height=64 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/44c2488108ac69eb0b786bf32938e7db.poster.avif?t=1738305487\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/44c2488108ac69eb0b786bf32938e7db.webm?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119450/extras/44c2488108ac69eb0b786bf32938e7db.mp4?t=1738305487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Got it...?\u2665</h2>",
